1:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"combining","level":"A1","guideword":"FORM: COMBINING TWO ADJECTIVES WITH 'AND'","canDo":"Can use 'and' to join a limited range of common adjectives.","example":"The teachers are very nice and friendly . (A1 BREAKTHROUGH; 2007; Polish; Pass)"},
