4:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"combining","level":"B1","guideword":"FORM: COMBINING COMPARATIVE ADJECTIVES WITH 'AND'","canDo":"Can use 'and' to join a limited range of comparative adjectives.► adjectives: comparatives","example":"In the winter you can go to the fitness centre, there you can get stronger and fitter. (Switzerland; B1 THRESHOLD; 2009; Swiss German; Pass)"},
