7:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"combining","level":"B1","guideword":"FORM: COMPOUND ADJECTIVES","canDo":"Can use a limited range of compound adjectives ('good-looking', 'well-known')","example":"He was tall and good-looking. (B1 THRESHOLD; 2007; Polish; Pass)"},
