23:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"comparatives","level":"B1","guideword":"FORM/USE: WITH 'A (LITTLE) BIT'","canDo":"Can use 'a (little) bit' to modify comparative adjectives used predicatively after a verb, usually 'be'.","example":"He's 15, a bit smaller than me, dark hair, brown eyes. (France; B1 THRESHOLD; 2003; French; Pass)"},
