25:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"comparatives","level":"B1","guideword":"FORM/USE: WITH 'EVEN'","canDo":"Can use 'even' to modify and intensify comparative adjectives used predicatively after a verb, usually 'be' and 'get'.","example":"[talking about a series of films] I'm sure you've seen part one already, but part two was even better! (Thailand; B1 THRESHOLD; 2002; Thai; Pass)"},
