32:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"modifying","level":"A2","guideword":"FORM: WITH DEGREE ADVERBS","canDo":"Can use adverbs of degree ('really', 'so', 'quite') with an increasing range of common gradable adjectives.","example":"It was sunny and really hot every day! (Argentina; A2 WAYSTAGE; 2009; Spanish - Latin American; Pass)"},
