40:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"modifying","level":"B2","guideword":"FORM: WITH 'ENOUGH' + 'TO'-INFINITIVE","canDo":"Can use 'enough' after adjectives followed by 'to'-infinitive","example":"[talking about an arts festival] I was lucky enough to take part in it last November, and I enjoyed it immensely. (Mexico; B2 VANTAGE; 2000; Spanish - Latin American; Pass)"},
