58:{"superCategory":"ADJECTIVES","subCategory":"superlatives","level":"A2","guideword":"FORM/USE: COMPLEX NOUN PHRASES","canDo":"Can form a limited range of complex noun phrases with a superlative adjective  + prepositional phrase, to talk about something unique.► noun phrases ►  clauses: comparison","example":"It is the biggest zoo in the world. (Hong Kong; A2 WAYSTAGE; 2001; Chinese; Pass)"},
