81:{"superCategory":"ADVERBS","subCategory":"adverbs as modifiers","level":"A1","guideword":"USE: PLACE","canDo":"Can use a limited range of adverbs ('here', 'there') to indicate place.","example":"My girlfriend is here with me. (A1 BREAKTHROUGH; 2007; Slovak; Pass)"},
